        "input_key": "LoadAudioState",
        "label": "Song",
        "encode": "pixaroma_audio",
        "accept": "audio",
        "_why": "Same hidden-state pattern as the prompt: the chosen file arrives as LoadAudioState, a JSON string naming a file in ComfyUI's input folder - which is what /api/upload returns.",
        "control": "audio",
        "_control": "The graph holds no value here - the file lives in a hidden JSON state - so the usual test for an upload slot finds nothing and this rendered as a text box. `audio` rather than `file` because the node takes a start and a length as well, and picking those needs to be able to hear the file."
      },
